Subject: [PATCH 527/913] core: add quiet option

Since some optional package are checked during build. The option quiet
is added to remove warnings during build

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/optee_os.git c87e614b86738c195892b585a302a2cf21c4fabb core: add quiet option]
Change-Id: Ic6fa1839c4c9c7b42a25e007b50a8db8161dd1bd
Signed-off-by: Michel JAOUEN <michel.jaouen@st.com>
---
 core/lib/scmi-server/SCP-firmware/CMakeLists.txt | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/core/lib/scmi-server/SCP-firmware/CMakeLists.txt b/core/lib/scmi-server/SCP-firmware/CMakeLists.txt
index b41b2a33a..0b99593d6 100644
--- a/core/lib/scmi-server/SCP-firmware/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/core/lib/scmi-server/SCP-firmware/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -556,7 +556,7 @@ endforeach()
 # Configure cmake-format.
 #
 
-find_package(CMakeFormat OPTIONAL_COMPONENTS Format Lint)
+find_package(CMakeFormat QUIET OPTIONAL_COMPONENTS Format Lint)
 
 if(TARGET CMakeFormat::Format)
     add_custom_target(
